---
description: Select this plugin's engineering workflows and preserve review history.
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the installed ai-agent-skills collection when relevant. Read anti-ai-writing
before drafting human-facing text. For workflow selection, read using-skills;
load the applicable procedure rather than every skill. For an accepted Plan-to-Build
request, use implement-plan, including verification and final independent code-review.
Use the plan's source requirements and preserve authorization already given.

Respect repository instructions and task scope. A skill does not authorize new
external actions. Never dismiss GitHub reviews or approvals or enable automatic
stale-review dismissal. Request re-review only when authorized. If required skills
or independent review are unavailable, disclose that limit instead of claiming completion.
